{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/f38dbd79d06bdb19b04f12cda499e9a1.poster.avif?t=1755784338\" aria-label=\"Pandora&#039;s Sack\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/f38dbd79d06bdb19b04f12cda499e9a1.webm?t=1755784338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a night out with his friends, Pandora forgot his esteemed sack on a filthy remote junkyard. After realizing his mistake the next morning, he finds out the sack is missing. Using his unconventional powers and weird minions, he resorts to uncensored violence to recover his precious sack. Can you get away with it safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/819d56f4c12ea749a439295fcefd787b.poster.avif?t=1755784338\" aria-label=\"Runes breaking on a grid\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/819d56f4c12ea749a439295fcefd787b.webm?t=1755784338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/819d56f4c12ea749a439295fcefd787b.mp4?t=1755784338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defend from Pandora's army, you'll need to summon an army of your own. Lucky for you, there's everything inside the sack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropping runes into the grid and breaking them will perhaps summon an army to protect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize the way your runes falls, maximizing combinations and synergies, improving your odds of wining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/d9777f008808ead066170a0e173abafa.poster.avif?t=1755784338\" aria-label=\"Big armies battle\" width=616 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/d9777f008808ead066170a0e173abafa.webm?t=1755784338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/d9777f008808ead066170a0e173abafa.mp4?t=1755784338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take, buy, gamble, steal, fight for it... obtain runes and items from a multitude of ways. A series of randomized events and battles will path your campaign to Pandora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704100/extras/cb77127dc303f672cabe26a0f8f69f1f.avif?t=1755784338\" width=616 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play characters with their own set of runes and features, transforming each campaign unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/